# Knowledge graph: NOT blanket-ignored.
# graphify-out/graph.json is tracked, stored gzipped in git via the gzip_graph
# clean/smudge filter (see .gitattributes + scripts/setup-git.sh). The working
# tree keeps flat JSON; only the git blob is compressed. Per-directory rules
# live in graphify-out/.gitignore, which declares what is tracked vs regenerable.

